  "ig_caption": "He didn't fire her because she was bad.\nHe fired her because a workflow was better.\n\n$45k/year admin role. Gone.\nLeads come in through GoHighLevel.\nClaude writes the quotes.\nN8N books the jobs.\n\nHe sleeps in on Sundays now.\n\nWant one?\n\n#AIAutomation #Accelod #ClaudeAI #N8N #GoHighLevel #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #WorkflowAutomation #AIAgents #SmallBusinessOwner #NoCode #SaaS #Solopreneur #DigitalTransformation #TechStack #ScaleYourBusiness #AITools #MarketingAutomation #ProductivityHacks #FutureOfWork #TradesBusiness #Electrician #AutomationAgency #LeadGeneration #SmartBusiness",
  "fb_caption": "He didn't fire her because she was bad.\nHe fired her because a workflow was better.\n\nA $45k/year admin role replaced by three tools talking to each other. GoHighLevel catches the leads. Claude writes the quotes. N8N schedules the jobs.\n\nZero dropped leads. Zero missed calls. He actually sleeps in on Sundays now.\n\nStill running your business on spreadsheets and sticky notes?\n\n#Accelod #AIAutomation #WorkflowAutomation #SmallBusiness",
